    <bpmn:process id="W_W4569" name="W4569. Loan Servicing Coordination, Payment &amp; Customer Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Loan active (W4568); payment cycle; servicing query
Frequency: Per cycle + per query
Volume: Servicing coordination across active loans (lender services; BuildRight supports)
Owner: Lenders (servicing) / Finance Desk (support)
Participants: Customer Support (VS-13), Treasury (VS-18), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4569 — Loan Servicing Coordination, Payment &amp; Customer Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4569_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4569_Lane1" name="Lenders">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4569_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4569_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4569_Lane2" name="Finance Desk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4569_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4569_Lane3" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4569_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4569_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4569_Start5" name="Loan active (W4568); payment cycle; servicing query">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4569_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4569_Task6" name="Lenders service the loan (amortization, collections, statements, payoff) — the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lenders service the loan (amortization, collections, statements, payoff) — the lender&#x27;s role; BuildRight does not service, only coordinates customer queries
Responsible (R): Lenders
Accountable (A): Lender Servicing Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4569_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4569_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4569_Task7" name="Finance Desk/Customer Support handle BuildRight-side queries (payment channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Desk/Customer Support handle BuildRight-side queries (payment channel, statement, draw status W4567), routing lender-specific items to the lender (VS-13)
Responsible (R): Finance Desk / Customer Support
Accountable (A): Finance Desk Lead
Duration: Per query</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4569_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4569_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4569_Task8" name="Treasury/Finance Desk coordinate payment/draw timing where BuildRight billing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury/Finance Desk coordinate payment/draw timing where BuildRight billing interacts with loan draws (W4567/W4568), ensuring clean settlement
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance Desk
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4569_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4569_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4569_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4569_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-694 (ensure controlled execution — Loan Servicing, Referral Economics, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-154.3).) | - CTL-694: lender services the loan (boundary clear); BuildRight coordinates queries (VS-13); draw-billing reconciled (VS-18)
Owner: Lenders (servicing) / Finance Desk (support)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4569_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4569_Annotation10" targetRef="W4569_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
