    <bpmn:process id="W_W4571" name="W4571. Draw-Milestone Monitoring, Variation &amp; Project-Loan Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project milestone (VS-66/VS-12); variation; draw (W4567)
Frequency: Per milestone + on variation
Volume: Milestone/variation reconciliation across active financed projects
Owner: Project Design (VS-66) / Finance Desk / Lenders
Participants: Installation (VS-12), Trade (VS-11), Treasury (VS-18), Risk (VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W4571 — Draw-Milestone Monitoring, Variation &amp; Project-Loan Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4571_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4571_Lane1" name="Project Design">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4571_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4571_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4571_Lane2" name="Finance Desk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4571_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4571_Lane3" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4571_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4571_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4571_Start5" name="Project milestone (VS-66/VS-12); variation; draw (W4567)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4571_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4571_Task6" name="Project Design/Installation confirm milestone completion (VS-66/VS-12) to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Design/Installation confirm milestone completion (VS-66/VS-12) to trigger the next draw (W4567), with evidence (inspection, photos)
Responsible (R): Project Design / Installation
Accountable (A): Project Design Manager
Duration: Per milestone</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4571_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4571_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4571_Task7" name="Finance Desk/Lenders manage project variations (scope/cost change → loan/draw…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance Desk/Lenders manage project variations (scope/cost change → loan/draw adjustment), per VS-66 change-control &amp; lender process
Responsible (R): Finance Desk / Lenders / Project Design
Accountable (A): Finance Desk Lead / Lender UW Manager
Duration: Per variation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4571_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4571_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4571_Task8" name="Treasury/Finance reconcile project cost (BuildRight billing) vs loan draw…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury/Finance reconcile project cost (BuildRight billing) vs loan draw (funding) across the project lifecycle, flagging gaps (VS-17/VS-18)
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4571_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4571_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4571_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4571_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-113 (ensure construction-finance brokerage compliance.) | - CTL-694: milestones evidence-confirmed (VS-66/VS-12); variations change-controlled to draw; cost-vs-funding reconciled (VS-17/VS-18)
Owner: Project Design (VS-66) / Finance Desk / Lenders</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4571_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4571_Annotation10" targetRef="W4571_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
