    <bpmn:process id="W_W4572" name="W4572. Delinquency, Default &amp; BuildRight Exposure Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Borrower delinquency/default (lender signal); project stall
Frequency: On delinquency/default
Volume: Delinquency/default cases (lender manages; BuildRight manages exposure)
Owner: Lenders (collection) / Risk (VS-21.2) / Finance (VS-17)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Trade (VS-11), Customer Support (VS-13), Treasury (VS-18)
Source: workflow W4572 — Delinquency, Default &amp; BuildRight Exposure Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4572_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4572_Lane1" name="Lenders">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4572_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4572_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4572_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4572_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4572_Lane3" name="Risk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4572_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4572_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4572_Start5" name="Borrower delinquency/default (lender signal); project stall">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4572_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4572_Task6" name="Lenders manage collection/foreclosure on default (the lender&#x27;s loan)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Lenders manage collection/foreclosure on default (the lender&#x27;s loan); BuildRight/Risk assess BuildRight&#x27;s exposure (delivered-but-unpaid materials/services if billing led draws)
Responsible (R): Lenders / Risk / Finance
