    <bpmn:process id="W_W4576" name="W4576. Program Performance Review, Risk &amp; Strategic Adjustment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; strategic shift; underperformance
Frequency: Annual + on trigger
Volume: Program performance review &amp; strategic adjustment
Owner: CFO / CMO / Finance Strategy / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: Risk (VS-21.2), Legal (VS-100.3), Board (VS-36), Commercial
Source: workflow W4576 — Program Performance Review, Risk &amp; Strategic Adjustment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4576_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4576_Lane1" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4576_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4576_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4576_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4576_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4576_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4576_Start3" name="Annual review; strategic shift; underperformance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4576_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4576_Task4" name="CFO/CMO/Strategy review the program vs W4553 success metrics (basket-lift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CFO/CMO/Strategy review the program vs W4553 success metrics (basket-lift, referral revenue, conversion, risk-adjusted return), and the strategic rationale
Responsible (R): CFO / CMO / Strategy
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4576_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4576_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4576_Task5" name="CFO/Strategy/Legal evaluate strategic adjustments (expand/restructure products…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO/Strategy/Legal evaluate strategic adjustments (expand/restructure products, change partners, tighten/loosen credit policy, exit) if performance/rationale changes
Responsible (R): CFO / Strategy / Legal / Risk
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: On trigger</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4576_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4576_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4576_Task6" name="CFO/CMO execute the chosen path (adjust product/partner/credit-policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO/CMO execute the chosen path (adjust product/partner/credit-policy W4556/W4554/W4557), with OCM (VS-134), and report to the board (VS-36)
Responsible (R): CFO / CMO / OCM
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4576_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4576_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4576_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4576_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-694 (ensure controlled execution — Loan Servicing, Referral Economics, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-154.3).) | - CTL-694: program reviewed vs success metrics (W4553); adjustments legal-validated (brokerage-only VS-100.3); board-reported (VS-36)
Owner: CFO / CMO / Finance Strategy / Strategy (VS-33)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
